+## 1. Mixed-clause extraction
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Add a pure, allowlisted action-plus-product clause extractor in the query canonicalization path that emits at most one distinct product-bearing alternate; verify focused canonicalization tests cover an eligible mixed line and preserve its product, DN/PN, connection, material, and control evidence.
